&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-583036-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Referring to the November 9th 1970 edition of Time magazine, focusing on the recent United States Congress election.&lt;/div&gt;
