&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-2571/craggle.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot; alt=&quot;craggle.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:300px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artistic rendition of a tree featured in SCP-2571 (&amp;quot;The Old Craggle Tree&amp;quot;).&lt;/p&gt;
